/**
 * @page doc_modules Modules
 *
 * @brief [en] The module groups: one per public folder, so the site can be read by area rather than by file.
 * @brief [zh] 模块分组：每个公开目录一组，于是站点能按领域读，而不是按文件读。
 * @note [en] `@defgroup` is what makes a group exist; `@ingroup` in a file's `/*! \@file … */` block is what puts
 *            the file in it. Both were unused in this tree until now, which is why the published site had no Topics
 *            tab at all: 125 file pages, 0 groups. The groups follow the folders `doc_doxygen_folders` already scans,
 *            so a file cannot be in a group its folder is not in.
 * @note [zh] `\@defgroup` 负责让一个组存在；文件 `/*! \@file … */` 块里的 `\@ingroup` 负责把它放进去。此前本树两者
 *            都没用，所以发布出来的站点根本没有「模块」标签页：125 个文件页、0 个分组。分组跟随
 *            `doc_doxygen_folders` 已经在扫的目录，因此文件不可能落在它所在目录之外的分组里。
 * @since 0.1.0
 */

/**
 * @defgroup group_c_api The C ABI
 *
 * @brief [en] The frozen C surface: handles, structs, enums and the entry points a C consumer links against.
 * @brief [zh] 冻结的 C 表面：句柄、结构体、枚举，以及 C 消费方链接的入口。
 */

/**
 * @defgroup group_core The algorithm core
 *
 * @brief [en] The control kernel: transforms, observers, modulators, protection and the tuning primitives.
 * @brief [zh] 控制内核：变换、观测器、调制器、保护与整定原语。
 */

/**
 * @defgroup group_comm Communication
 *
 * @brief [en] Register maps, framing and encoder streams: how a host talks to the library.
 * @brief [zh] 寄存器映射、组帧与编码器数据流：上位机与库对话的方式。
 */

/**
 * @defgroup group_driver Drivers
 *
 * @brief [en] The HAL implementations shipped with the library: board bring-up, stubs and bench drivers.
 * @brief [zh] 库自带的 HAL 实现：板级启动、桩件与台架驱动。
 */

/**
 * @defgroup group_hal Hardware contracts
 *
 * @brief [en] What a host must provide: the interfaces the library is written against, with no platform in them.
 * @brief [zh] 主控方必须提供什么：库所面向的接口，里面没有任何平台相关的东西。
 */

/**
 * @defgroup group_motor The motor object
 *
 * @brief [en] Composition and lifecycle: the object that owns an observer, a modulator and the control loop.
 * @brief [zh] 组合与生命周期：持有观测器、调制器与控制环的那个对象。
 */
